{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:975","content":{"id":975,"title":"闪卡","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学习分为学和习，古人讲学而时习之，除了学之外我们还要经常复习，这样才能反复且持续的激活神经元，只有激活了正确的神经元，那才是有效的学习。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而闪卡就是一个非常有效的复习手段，它的正面印着问题，反面印着答案，我们需要在不看答案的前提下去主动回忆回答问题，主动回忆可以激活我们的神经元，是非常有效的学习手段。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"闪卡可以自己制作，也可以通过 AI 生成，如果要通过 AI 生成，那么需要在大语言模型中进行配置"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_cf71da32-4a95-42bd-b034-783d532258a0.webp","uuid":"5ff7cfab-0222-4aa3-887f-315e31f67399","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_cf71da32-4a95-42bd-b034-783d532258a0.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们支持五种题目类型："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"单选"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"多选"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"填空"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"判断"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"简答"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8d7ef059-66c4-43b9-9bad-7ea4f50ac5ad.webp","uuid":"10e4c1c5-9c5a-4175-b18a-9ed2aeea8bb2","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8d7ef059-66c4-43b9-9bad-7ea4f50ac5ad.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"AI 生成闪卡后我们可以先评估下题目是否合理，难度是否符合要求，没问题的话就可以添加到卡组中，然后就可以在闪卡中心进行复习"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_703d5326-44d4-419e-baef-ae18b6930285.webp","uuid":"19465f33-c345-4e4e-ad9d-fadacfa6893b","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_703d5326-44d4-419e-baef-ae18b6930285.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击开始回顾就开始复习需要复习的卡片"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5dc6f24b-6c40-473c-b905-39106028f787.webp","uuid":"87bba26e-7f3f-43c0-aa8e-308df38add23","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5dc6f24b-6c40-473c-b905-39106028f787.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每轮在回答问题后，需要自我评估，以解决掌握情况，并且决定多久之后重新安排复习这个问题，如果自我评估困难，就会到时隔不久后再次安排，如果掌握的比较轻松，那么就会时隔多日后在安排，通过这种间隔重复的方式来帮助你掌握知识点。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于简答题，可以使用 AI 来进行评判"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6621488f-7ce5-4bff-a5b7-62120dd4b66d.webp","uuid":"4612a577-c899-4e68-a06c-fe5aefba6948","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6621488f-7ce5-4bff-a5b7-62120dd4b66d.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要使用这个功能，需要在大语言模型中配置答案评判的模型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ac0a84a9-33af-49c5-b9b0-326546fd8a04.webp","uuid":"5819d869-7927-4aa1-aef6-a0641ded73f1","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ac0a84a9-33af-49c5-b9b0-326546fd8a04.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回答完成之后，就可以看到下次什么时候需要再次复习"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d4ab9713-5ef9-40cc-8015-b8662a109b05.webp","uuid":"e52f8782-0c65-41b4-993c-8da4c49d4cbd","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d4ab9713-5ef9-40cc-8015-b8662a109b05.webp","width":720}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},{"label":"闪卡","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:975","type":"doc","id":975}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Vibe Learning","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:973","type":"doc","id":973}},"nextPage":{"title":"微信读书","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:754","type":"doc","id":754}},"createTime":1777716804838,"updateTime":1777722688247,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777722688247}}